    Bug 1979410 - Restore cleanup of identity special folders on pref change. r=edicharry,welpy-cw
    I removed a bit too much when changing how special folders worked. This is restores the original
    functionality, but not the code as it was. Now we only remove the folder's flag if no identity
    is still using the folder.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D258844

